1
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,940
(Shen Teng)

2
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:09,540
(Bai Jingting)

3
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:11,740
(Jia Bing)

4
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,820
(Hu Xianxu)

5
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:18,300
(Wang Anyu)

6
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:20,580
(Fan Chengcheng)

7
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:22,820
(Huang Jingyu)

8
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,860
(Wang Churan)

9
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:30,300
=Natural High S4 (Bonus Episode)=

10
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,760
The next challenge

11
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,240
is Slow-Motion Witness.

12
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,600
(Slow-Motion Witness)
All must balance water on their heads.

13
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,160
(Slow-Motion Witness)
Of the eight players,

14
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,680
one is secretly the leaf sheep.

15
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:40,720
The other seven are algae.

16
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:42,000
Algae must complete seven

17
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,000
(Pufferfish, Seahorse, Conch, Whale)
sea creature drawings.

18
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:43,700
(Stingray, Dolphin, Jellyfish, Sea Bream)

19
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,920
Meanwhile, the leaf sheep must use

20
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,720
(Slow-Motion Witness)
a special move to catch algae.

21
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,520
(20-second cooldown after each attack)
Each attack has a 20-second cooldown.

22
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,280
The leaf sheep can also

23
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:51,680
destroy the algae's drawings.

24
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:53,280
(Alarm station)
Anyone who spots something suspicious

25
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,840
(Alarm station)
can sound the alarm at the assigned spot.

26
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,040
(Drawing station)
There are eight drawing stations

27
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:57,200
spread across the underwater world.

28
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:59,760
Finish seven drawings,
and the algae win.

29
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:02,160
(How the leaf sheep wins)
Catch four algae, and the leaf sheep wins.

30
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:03,040
(How algae is eliminated)
And one more thing.

31
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:05,920
Run out of water, and you're out.

32
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:07,770
One bonus round.

33
00:01:07,790 --> 00:01:09,120
(Role assignment)
Draw your roles, please.

34
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:22,660
(Slow-Motion Witness begins!)

35
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:26,100
(Searching for a drawing station)

36
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:29,300
(Leaf sheep: Secret)

37
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:31,100
(Sneaking around)

38
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:43,500
(Algae progress: 1/7)

39
00:01:50,260 --> 00:01:53,820
(Drawing completed!)

40
00:01:53,860 --> 00:01:55,620
(Both on high alert)

41
00:01:58,320 --> 00:01:59,640
Look how steady I am.

42
00:02:02,620 --> 00:02:05,020
(Found a drawing station)

43
00:02:10,260 --> 00:02:12,180
(Algae progress: 2/7)

44
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:16,800
Stay back, Churan.

45
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,440
(On guard)
Come any closer, and I'll jump in.

46
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,240
I'm serious.

47
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,720
(Closing in)

48
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:22,200
We're on the same team.

49
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:24,980
(Circling the tree)
We wouldn't attack our own teammates.

50
00:02:25,620 --> 00:02:27,180
(I'll trust you for now)

51
00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:30,420
(One leaves, another shows up)
You drew this?

52
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,440
Yeah.

53
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,440
Stay back.

54
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,560
Come any closer, and I'll jump in.

55
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:35,480
I'm one of the good guys this round.

56
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:36,800
(Don't come closer!)

57
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,680
Still a fifty-fifty chance.

58
00:02:39,040 --> 00:02:40,200
I already finished one drawing.

59
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,360
I drew the seahorse.

60
00:02:41,940 --> 00:02:43,740
(Not buying it)

61
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:45,320
You won't do anything to me, right?

62
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,760
If you try anything, I'll scream.

63
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:49,000
I'm definitely one of the good guys.

64
00:02:50,580 --> 00:02:52,020
(On guard)

65
00:02:58,100 --> 00:03:00,060
(Algae progress: 3/7)

66
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,280
Any drawings here?

67
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,400
Already done.

68
00:03:03,420 --> 00:03:04,900
(Too late)

69
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,480
Let's go.

70
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:07,420
(Trust him? Or not?)

71
00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:08,320
You're seriously suspicious.

72
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:11,080
No, it's just the look on your face.

73
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,800
In a good way, though.

74
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:14,920
You seem really suspicious.

75
00:03:15,940 --> 00:03:16,940
(Safer from a distance)

76
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,160
There must be one in that room.

77
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:19,360
Let me go check.

78
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,480
Here's one.

79
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:24,020
Great.

80
00:03:24,020 --> 00:03:24,460
(Algae progress: 3/7)

81
00:03:24,460 --> 00:03:26,380
(Algae progress: 4/7)

82
00:03:27,060 --> 00:03:28,860
(Keeping an eye on him)

83
00:03:28,900 --> 00:03:31,500
(An ally!)

84
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,160
Chengcheng.

85
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,600
Let's watch each other's backs.

86
00:03:35,660 --> 00:03:37,700
(Treading carefully)

87
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:39,880
Why is Churan acting...

88
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:42,240
so suspicious again?

89
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:45,720
Wait. I was just...

90
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:47,160
I didn't even notice you earlier.

91
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:49,980
(Here comes the flood!)

92
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:51,240
Are you okay?

93
00:03:51,980 --> 00:03:52,860
(It's raining on my head)

94
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:53,920
What's with you?

95
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:54,840
You...

96
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:55,520
What?

97
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:02,020
(A quiet entrance)

98
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,640
Here comes the biggest suspect.

99
00:04:04,180 --> 00:04:05,040
(Scaring you off!)

100
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:06,120
You scared me.

101
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:09,360
I think he did that on purpose.

102
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,200
I was just trying to scare you

103
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:11,120
and make you spill some water.

104
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,480
You've got the least water left.

105
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:13,720
He's the most suspicious.

106
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:15,060
(Running dangerously low)

107
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:20,800
Did you draw it?

108
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,520
Yes.

109
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,840
Teng, did you finish yours?

110
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,240
All done.

111
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,000
You drew one?

112
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:28,600
He drew a fish by the pool.

113
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,240
I can vouch for that fish.

114
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,120
I saw it earlier.

115
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:33,280
(Over halfway there)
Great. Four drawings done.

116
00:04:33,340 --> 00:04:35,780
(Pufferfish drawing station,
Jellyfish drawing station)

117
00:04:39,660 --> 00:04:41,220
(Jellyfish drawing station)

118
00:04:44,900 --> 00:04:47,420
(Pufferfish drawing station)

119
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:50,680
Nothing over here.

120
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:53,200
Anything over there?

121
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:54,920
Yeah, I found one.

122
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:57,760
Then I'll stay here. You draw it.

123
00:05:01,540 --> 00:05:03,980
(Deliberately drawing the wrong creature
to mislead everyone)

124
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,760
Leaf sheep, open your eyes.

125
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:07,300
(Leaf sheep)

126
00:05:07,300 --> 00:05:11,680
(Leaf sheep: Bai Jingting)

127
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:13,120
Nothing over here either.

128
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,520
Then why did you go into my room?

129
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:15,160
What were you doing in there?

130
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,240
Just checking if you'd drawn anything.

131
00:05:16,300 --> 00:05:17,260
(Tailing him)

132
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:19,000
Bai!

133
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:19,960
Stop following me!

134
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:20,680
If I get eliminated...

135
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,960
Why did you go into my room?

136
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:23,060
You drew it? Okay.

137
00:05:23,060 --> 00:05:24,440
(In the clear for now)

138
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:25,880
Anything over here?

139
00:05:25,940 --> 00:05:26,960
(The real jellyfish drawing station)

140
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:28,080
I don't think so.

141
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:32,200
Bai! You...

142
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,840
I already drew it!
Why are you still there?

143
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:35,240
Thanks.

144
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:37,080
But I can handle this room myself.

145
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:38,980
(Treading carefully)

146
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:40,600
I didn't find anything.

147
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:44,280
He's so suspicious.

148
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,600
He's trying to destroy my drawing.

149
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:46,960
He's trying to destroy my drawing.

150
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,560
Okay. Hu?

151
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,360
A jellyfish?

152
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,280
A jellyfish.

153
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:58,800
Hu.

154
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:01,240
(Algae progress: 5/7)

155
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,080
Over here, Bing.

156
00:06:02,830 --> 00:06:04,120
I finished a drawing.

157
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:04,920
I drew a jellyfish.

158
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:05,700
Okay.

159
00:06:07,140 --> 00:06:09,140
(Bing leaves first)

160
00:06:09,220 --> 00:06:12,380
(Still watching)

161
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,680
Why did you draw a jellyfish too?

162
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:18,020
(Two jellyfish drawings)

163
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,240
My station said to draw a jellyfish.

164
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,040
What did you draw?

165
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:28,780
(This round's attack move:
pinch any body part)

166
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:30,640
You're out.

167
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:31,980
(Hu Xianxu (Algae) gets eaten!)

168
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,800
Something's happened.

169
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:37,640
What is it?

170
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:38,680
Hu's out.

171
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:41,680
Who's missing?

172
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,440
Whoever shows up next is our suspect.

173
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:44,680
(Identifying suspects by arrival order)
Bai.

174
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,200
Bai might be out too.

175
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:52,620
(Putting on an act)

176
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:54,960
Wait.

177
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:55,480
Bing!

178
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,520
Bing came from that way too.

179
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:58,160
Bing! Sound the alarm.

180
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:59,080
I think it's Bing.

181
00:06:59,280 --> 00:06:59,720
Yeah.

182
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,520
I think Bai is already out.

183
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:03,080
Sound the alarm.

184
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:03,600
He's right here.

185
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,000
(The villagers sound the alarm)
He's still in the game.

186
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:06,960
He's right here.

187
00:07:06,980 --> 00:07:08,180
(His excuse for showing up late)

188
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,720
Stop acting like someone beat you up.

189
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:11,760
What?

190
00:07:13,660 --> 00:07:15,420
(Underwater meeting: Round 1)
Why did you sound the alarm?

191
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,440
Because Hu's out.

192
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:17,520
Because Hu's out,

193
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:19,080
and the killer is coming

194
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:20,240
straight for us.

195
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:22,120
So to protect ourselves,

196
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,520
we had to sound the alarm first.

197
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:25,120
When Hu was eliminated,

198
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:28,080
Churan, Teng, Jingyu,

199
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:29,600
Chengcheng, and I were together.

200
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,560
That leaves only you and Bai.

201
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,400
You two came from that direction.

202
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:34,940
(Only two suspects)
Just the two of you.

203
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,080
But I think

204
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:38,840
Bing still has a lot of water.

205
00:07:39,900 --> 00:07:40,860
(Filled to the brim)

206
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:41,960
His container is really full.

207
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:44,440
I doubt he could've moved that fast.

208
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:46,300
(Impressed)

209
00:07:46,460 --> 00:07:47,700
(Yes! Keep that logic coming!)

210
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:49,240
I have plenty of water too.

211
00:07:49,500 --> 00:07:50,440
(Really?)

212
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:52,080
(Let me explain)
No, it couldn't have been me.

213
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,520
I saw Bai,

214
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:55,520
then Hu,

215
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:56,400
and came straight here.

216
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:57,840
I have no idea

217
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:58,640
when Hu was eliminated.

218
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:01,480
I think we should vote Bai out first.

219
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:03,080
(In danger!)
On what grounds?

220
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:04,320
He took too long to get here.

221
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:05,920
I was at the very back.

222
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:07,600
Of course he took longer.

223
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,840
Real nosebleed

224
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:10,120
or fake,

225
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,440
he still had to hold his nose.

226
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:14,440
But if Hu had only shouted,

227
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,760
and we were already here...

228
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,960
Then where was I supposed to be?

229
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:19,520
You'd be on your way, or...

230
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:20,280
If I was really

231
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:20,680
on my way,

232
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,920
wouldn't you have seen me?

233
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,600
The way Bai is acting right now

234
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,440
doesn't seem innocent.

235
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:26,720
Exactly.

236
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,040
Then how should an innocent person act?

237
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:29,000
They should just deny it.

238
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,000
(Feeling wronged)

239
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,480
I was innocent in the last round too,

240
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,520
and I hardly said anything.

241
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:33,960
Did you go over there?

242
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,200
I think you headed that way.

243
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,040
Didn't you see me

244
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:37,280
draw the seahorse?

245
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:39,080
(Making a heart sign)

246
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,240
You even came inside.

247
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:41,760
You came in and made a hand gesture.

248
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:42,600
I don't even know what that was.

249
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:46,880
Don't make things up.

250
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:47,960
Just say what actually happened,

251
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,720
not whatever pops into your head.

252
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:51,240
Wait, Bing.

253
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:53,880
You sure you're someone
who'd just make random hand gestures?

254
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:56,360
(Totally sidetracked)
Doing this and that for no reason?

255
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:57,760
He's casting a spell.

256
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,840
So I took him out with a hand gesture?

257
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,160
But he...

258
00:09:01,160 --> 00:09:02,040
He's not even out, though.

259
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,720
Did you die when I did that?

260
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,440
I walked right past you, didn't I?

261
00:09:06,860 --> 00:09:08,580
(Holding back laughter)

262
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:10,280
He didn't get the chance to tell you.

263
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:12,040
He eliminated you but couldn't tell you.

264
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,000
You ran off too fast.

265
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:16,920
He's not quite dead yet.

266
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:18,000
He was drooling just now.

267
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,800
(Back from the dead)
Someone get him a tissue.

268
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:22,440
Bing.

269
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,360
Just tell me. Was it you?

270
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,520
Be honest. Was it you?

271
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:28,200
(Look me in the eye)

272
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,080
It wasn't me.

273
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:30,840
Let's vote!

274
00:09:31,060 --> 00:09:32,820
(Excited)
Let's vote!

275
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:33,920
(Just as excited)
Bing.

276
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:36,640
I'm voting. I think it's Bing.

277
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:37,720
Okay.

278
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:40,400
Listen, think this through.

279
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,480
(Acting serious, secretly thrilled)
Stop playing to the camera.

280
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,120
Take this seriously.

281
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:42,880
I'm absolutely...

282
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,440
Then give us your reason.

283
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:45,720
Like he ever has a reason.

284
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:46,560
We've done so many seasons together.

285
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:47,480
Don't you know him by now?

286
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,920
(No mercy!)
Has he ever made a good point?

287
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:53,440
Name one time.

288
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:54,840
I know Bing pretty well.

289
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:57,800
When Teng asked if he was the one,

290
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:59,760
Bing paused for a few seconds.

291
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:01,200
(Absolutely certain!)
So it has to be Bing.

292
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:01,860
(Lips, behave!)

293
00:10:01,860 --> 00:10:04,000
(Also suspicious of Bing)
Bing seems suspicious to me too.

294
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,120
Just vote already.

295
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:06,440
I believe you.

296
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,360
I believe you.

297
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,360
(Well, that's a relief)

298
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,140
Please cast your votes.

299
00:10:10,140 --> 00:10:11,960
(Abstain*1, Bai Jingting*2, Jia Bing*4)

300
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,360
Bing is out.

301
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,340
(Jia Bing eliminated)

302
00:10:15,020 --> 00:10:17,120
The game continues.

303
00:10:18,140 --> 00:10:20,020
(Proven innocent)

304
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:23,540
What?

305
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:24,380
(Trying to stay unnoticed)

306
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:25,600
Interesting!

307
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:28,000
Then it must be you.

308
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,520
(Still trying to talk his way out)
No, not me.

309
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:31,560
That's impossible. It still...

310
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,000
Still me?

311
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:34,300
(Who else?)

312
00:10:34,300 --> 00:10:35,800
Everyone, return to your spawn point.

313
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:38,340
(Slow-Motion Witness: Round 2 begins!)

314
00:10:38,340 --> 00:10:39,520
(Leaf sheep: Bai Jingting)

315
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:40,320
Let's go.

316
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:41,920
Meet at the alarm station.

317
00:10:42,060 --> 00:10:43,240
(Target acquired)

318
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,120
Shall we go?

319
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,600
Yeah. No more chances for him.

320
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:47,760
Where's Bai?

321
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:48,400
(Joining the group)
Let's go.

322
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:49,200
Where is he?

323
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,440
Wasn't his spawn point

324
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:52,080
way farther west?

325
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,880
Here he comes.

326
00:10:53,140 --> 00:10:55,540
(Target spotted!)

327
00:10:56,760 --> 00:10:58,040
Did you finish your drawing?

328
00:10:58,040 --> 00:10:58,840
Yeah, all done.

329
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,120
I'll take a look.

330
00:11:00,340 --> 00:11:02,780
(Watching closely)

331
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:09,820
(Blending in naturally)

332
00:11:10,780 --> 00:11:13,620
(Sticking close)

333
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:16,240
Can he take out three people in one go?

334
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:21,520
We'll never finish like this.

335
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,920
(I don't get it, but I'm in)
Tell us when you're done.

336
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:28,080
They look like the Calabash Brothers.

337
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,280
Come in and take the lead.

338
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:39,840
Shouldn't we give the Wolf some room?

339
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:40,660
(Probing him)

340
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:42,920
How about we let you play
for a while first?

341
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:44,360
Do you need some space?

342
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:44,880
Give me some space.

343
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:45,520
No need.

344
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,040
He doesn't want any space.

345
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,560
Close in. Surround him.

346
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:50,180
(Surrounded on all sides)

347
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,360
You think it's me?

348
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:53,800
If you suspected me,

349
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:54,680
why didn't you vote for me?

350
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:55,480
I voted for you.

351
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,440
It didn't go through.

352
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,620
(Like I didn't want to?)

353
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:58,600
You voted for me?

354
00:11:58,600 --> 00:11:59,520
He didn't vote for me.

355
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:00,640
Then why are you following me?

356
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:04,000
(Live Broadcast)
Now it's just torture.

357
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:05,600
No one dares to kill anyone.

358
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,760
How many pictures do we have so far?

359
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:08,640
Teng, did you draw yours?

360
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:09,120
I'm done.

361
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,480
One, two...

362
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:10,960
And three.

363
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:11,400
Three.

364
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:13,120
I haven't drawn mine.

365
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:15,320
Churan, you didn't draw yours?

366
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:16,240
Yeah, I didn't.

367
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:18,880
Are you afraid
of exposing your artistic skills?

368
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:20,100
(Just couldn't find it)

369
00:12:20,940 --> 00:12:22,220
(Right now)

370
00:12:22,900 --> 00:12:23,760
(Now)

371
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:24,480
Eliminated.

372
00:12:24,540 --> 00:12:26,380
(Fan Chengcheng (Algae) is eliminated)

373
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:34,080
(Undersea villager reports a crime)
I'm sounding the alarm.

374
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:36,240
(Still hasn't caught on)
That was so sudden! Why so sudden?

375
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,160
What's going on?

376
00:12:39,640 --> 00:12:40,400
Sound the alarm!

377
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:42,480
You scared me!

378
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,480
Sound the alarm!

379
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:50,040
Quick hands.

380
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,200
No, I didn't do anything.

381
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,600
I've been standing there the whole time.

382
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,120
Those were some quick hands.

383
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,920
Really quick, Bai.

384
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:57,720
It wasn't me.

385
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,280
I didn't do anything.

386
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:01,560
Come on, let's vote.

387
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,480
(Underwater meeting: Round 2)
I sounded the alarm.

388
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:05,240
I was the one who first noticed

389
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:07,800
that Fan Chengcheng had been killed.

390
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:11,000
And Bai was the closest person
to Fan Chengcheng.

391
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,120
Then Bai started

392
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:15,080
signaling to me.

393
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:18,440
But I turned around and sounded the alarm.

394
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:24,240
So I guess
I didn't catch his secret signal.

395
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:25,840
You deliberately avoided the attack.

396
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,160
Let's vote.

397
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:29,320
It wasn't me.
Who was standing next to him?

398
00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:30,480
You.

399
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:34,400
No, he was over there.

400
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:35,600
You were on his left, and...

401
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,400
His right side.

402
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:37,360
Teng.

403
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,320
Teng was over there.

404
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:39,880
Then it must've been Teng.

405
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,640
Could it really have been Teng?

406
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:46,900
(You just believe whatever he says)

407
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:49,600
Bai.

408
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:51,360
I just want to know

409
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:52,360
if we end up

410
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:54,960
deciding to vote for you,

411
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:56,440
is there anything you'd like to say?

412
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:58,480
Well,

413
00:13:58,480 --> 00:14:00,040
I think it was you, Teng.

414
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:01,340
(Insists it was Teng)

415
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:04,640
It had to be one
of the two people next to him.

416
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:05,760
I don't think it was me.

417
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:06,600
I mean, it wasn't me.

418
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:07,440
It just wasn't me.

419
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:09,420
(Still denying it?)

420
00:14:09,800 --> 00:14:12,200
Let's vote. Bai is number seven.

421
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:15,200
Three, two, one, vote.

422
00:14:15,260 --> 00:14:16,520
(Bai Jingting*4, Shen Teng*1)

423
00:14:16,520 --> 00:14:17,720
Bai has been eliminated.

424
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,880
Game

425
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:19,560
over.

426
00:14:24,760 --> 00:14:26,280
You coud high-five us

427
00:14:26,280 --> 00:14:27,560
after surviving the first round.

428
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:31,480
Let's go.

429
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,480
For the next mission,

430
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:36,000
(Forest Pictionary)
you'll split into two teams.

431
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,500
(This is how we'll split up)
Each team will compete in a timed

432
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:39,400
(Four-on-four guessing game)
four-on-four guessing game.

433
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:40,840
(Most correct guesses wins)
The first person acts it out

434
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:42,240
(How the relay works)
to pass the information to the second.

435
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:43,680
(First: Act it out)
After that,

436
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:46,520
(Second: Draw)
the second draws it for the third.

437
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:47,800
Once the third sees the drawing,

438
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:50,240
(Third: Act out the drawing)
they act it out for the fourth.

439
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,720
(Fourth: Guess the word)
The fourth has to guess the word.

440
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:53,760
Each turn lasts two minutes.

441
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:55,840
(Each person has two minutes)
Most correct guesses wins.

442
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,880
Let's see if you can

443
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:58,800
understand your teammates.

444
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:01,400
Teng's team can give us a demonstration.

445
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,880
We'll go first.

446
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:03,600
Okay.

447
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:04,080
We'll go first.

448
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:06,840
(Gun tong xi yi ji ba gong)
[*Front-loading washer on strike]

449
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:07,400
Come on.

450
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:08,760
Seven words.

451
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:10,000
(Words: Gun tong xi yi ji ba gong)
[*Front-loading washer on strike]

452
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:10,400
Look.

453
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:19,960
What is that?

454
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:21,040
Xi yi ji.
[*Washing machine]

455
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:23,080
"Xi yi ji" is...
[*Washing machine]

456
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:27,680
Third, fourth, and fifth words. Okay.

457
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:32,600
Spin.

458
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:36,640
Roll. Roll around in the washing machine.

459
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:42,880
Rolling around.

460
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:44,880
The first word is "zhuan".
[*Spin]

461
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:45,880
The first word is "gun".
[*Roll]

462
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:48,200
"Gun tong xi yi ji".
[*Front-loading washer]

463
00:15:49,660 --> 00:15:50,280
(The sixth word)

464
00:15:50,280 --> 00:15:50,840
Six.

465
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:52,360
"Ba".
[*Eight]

466
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:55,460
(The seventh word)
Seven.

467
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:56,360
Seven.

468
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,880
"Gun tong xi yi ji ba"?
[*Front-loading washer on]

469
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:05,240
"Ba she"?
[Eight, shoot]

470
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:10,600
"Ba gong".
[*Eight, bow]

471
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:14,400
"Gun tong xi yi ji ba gong".
[*Front-loading washer on strike]

472
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:16,680
(On strike)
"Gun tong xi yi ji ba gong"?

473
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,600
How do I draw that?

474
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:22,000
Just go on strike.

475
00:16:41,280 --> 00:16:42,080
Charging.

476
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:42,920
(How did she get that from the drawing?)

477
00:16:42,920 --> 00:16:46,040
It's under repair. It's being repaired.

478
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,080
What is this?

479
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:48,840
"Xi yi ji".
[*Washing machine]

480
00:16:50,520 --> 00:16:51,480
Words three, four, and five are correct.

481
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:53,360
What kind of washing machine?

482
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:56,080
Rolling washing machine.

483
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:57,800
Drum washing machine.

484
00:16:58,560 --> 00:16:59,920
Electric washing machine.

485
00:16:59,920 --> 00:17:00,880
Automatic washing machine.

486
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:05,120
I didn't know there were so many kinds
of washing machines.

487
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:09,690
(Volume down)
A washing machine.

488
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:12,480
A washing machine with water.

489
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:16,800
A spinning washing machine.

490
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,320
What kind of washing machine is this?

491
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:22,320
This is a household washing machine.

492
00:17:22,320 --> 00:17:23,400
A household washing machine.

493
00:17:30,700 --> 00:17:32,380
(Time's up)

494
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:34,160
Well, he drew the washing machine
pretty well.

495
00:17:35,020 --> 00:17:36,940
(Who understands how I feel?)

496
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:41,440
Looks like things didn't go
too smoothly earlier.

497
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,320
Three, four, five.

498
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:07,680
Burn it.

499
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:08,880
We're doomed.

500
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:19,720
Doing laundry.

501
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:23,680
"Xi yi ji".
[*Washing machine]

502
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:27,240
Words three, four, five are "xi yi ji".
[*Washing machine]

503
00:18:28,640 --> 00:18:29,440
First, second.

504
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:34,640
"Gun tong xi yi ji".
[*Front-loading washer]

505
00:18:34,660 --> 00:18:36,820
(That feeling of redemption)

506
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:41,400
There's more?

507
00:18:42,280 --> 00:18:43,200
Eight words.

508
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:45,020
(It's seven words! Seven words!)

509
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:49,960
Wang Churan,
you're really bad with numbers.

510
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:51,480
Seven words.

511
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,440
What are you acting out? Throw it away?

512
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:02,200
Blow it up?

513
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:03,360
The front-loading washer blew up?

514
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:07,160
No.

515
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:11,520
"Da li".
[*Strong]

516
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:14,000
She only noticed
the word "power" in "no power".

517
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:16,800
"Qiang jing".
[*Powerful]

518
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:19,120
"Qiang jing gun tong xi yi ji".
[*Powerful front-loading washer]

519
00:19:19,120 --> 00:19:20,320
"Qiang zhuang".
[*Strong-built]

520
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:23,020
She doesn't even know
what to act out now.

521
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,800
"Gun tong xi yi ji" is right, isn't it?

522
00:19:27,440 --> 00:19:29,840
Add two words at the beginning
or two at the end?

523
00:19:29,840 --> 00:19:32,560
At the end.
"Gun tong xi yi ji qiang jing".

524
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:36,400
"Qiang jing".
[*Powerful]

525
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:38,240
"Gun tong xi yi ji jie shi".
[*Front-loading washer is sturdy]

526
00:19:38,620 --> 00:19:39,900
(Correct word count: 5)

527
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:41,880
I don't think she even knows

528
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:42,560
what she's acting out.

529
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:43,640
What are you acting out, Churan?

530
00:19:45,040 --> 00:19:46,440
"Gun tong xi yi ji".
[*Front-loading washer]

531
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:48,280
It ran out of power.

532
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:49,440
It's broken.

533
00:19:49,760 --> 00:19:51,840
Then why are you acting like that?

534
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:52,840
Power.

535
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:54,880
Power?

536
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:58,800
Why didn't you act out "no power"?

537
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:03,440
Come on, tell everyone.

538
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:05,840
What are roller washers

539
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:07,000
and drum washers?

540
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:08,040
"Gun tong xi yi ji".
[*Front-loading washer]

541
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:09,840
Now you know
what a front-loading washer is?

542
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:11,800
I said it earlier, right?

543
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:12,520
No.

544
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:14,040
That's the only thing you didn't say.

545
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:14,920
You said everything else.

546
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:17,440
You guessed roller and drum.

547
00:20:19,080 --> 00:20:21,680
I couldn't express
the last two words clearly.

548
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:22,440
I didn't draw them well.

549
00:20:22,440 --> 00:20:23,000
What is it?

550
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:25,000
Can you even tell what it is?

551
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:25,920
"Gun tong xi yi ji" is correct.
